+# Result
+
+All six positive exceptions are resolved conditionally within the declared action. For t=2/3, 8/3 and 16/(4±√2), use the exact S3 vertex-stabilizer sector and gradient seed. For t=16/(6±√2), use the C4 cyclic sector and cycle seed. Retained field frequencies avoid 2 and 4; the Coulomb-corrected averaged drift is nonzero in every case. Exact fixed-point invariance prevents nonlinear excitation of excluded modes along these witnesses.
+
+Fixed species norms, exact initial Gauss constraints, a controlled O(1/epsilon) nonlinear comparison and a gauge-invariant higher-simplex population witness give nonlinear orbital departure. Together with prior NOI v0.1: all a>0, kappa>=0, finite r, alpha>0 for this nonzero flat family. Positive-stiffness vacuum stability is preserved. 104 exact checks; six numerical campaigns; no empirical evidence; independent review pending; physical promotion 0.
